  "body": "Handyman Services in the Blackburn Area\n\nFrom small repairs to home improvements, Paul the Handyman is here to get the job done right — on time and at a fair price.\n\nCovering Blackburn, Darwen, Rossendale, Clitheroe and surrounding areas.\n\nGet a Free Quote\nGuide Prices\nResidential\n\nFriendly, reliable handyman services for your home. From small repairs and odd jobs to ongoing maintenance, I'll help keep your living space safe, functional, and comfortable.\n\nCommercial\n\nExpert handyman services for shops, offices, and small businesses. Minimise downtime and keep your workplace running smoothly with dependable repairs and maintenance.\n\nLandlords\n\nQuick, affordable solutions for landlords and letting agents. I can handle property maintenance, tenant call-outs, and repair work to keep your rentals in great condition.\n\nPAUL\nTHE HANDYMAN\nBLACKBURN & LANCASHIRE\nWelcome from Paul the Handyman\n\nNeed a reliable pair of hands for those jobs around the house? I'm Paul, your local handyman, here to help with everything from small repairs and odd jobs to general home and property maintenance. Whether it's fixing, fitting, or freshening up, I take pride in offering friendly, trustworthy service at a fair price. No job is too small — if it matters to you, it matters to me.\n\n100% Satisfaction Guarantee\nFast Reliable Service\n20+ Years in Industry\nNo Job Too Small\nRequest a Quote\nKitchen Fitting in Blackburn\n\nA dedicated, premium service. From full kitchen installations to supply-only fitting, I install kitchens to a high standard across Blackburn and the Ribble Valley — independently, for every major brand.\n\nFull Kitchen Fitting\n\nComplete installations — units, worktops and appliances, fitted level, square and beautifully finished.\n\nRead More →\nSupply-Only Fitting\n\nBought your kitchen elsewhere? I’ll fit it for you and save you the retailer’s fitting premium.\n\nRead More →\nBrand Installations\n\nIndependent fitting for Wren, Howdens, Magnet and DIY Kitchens — often cheaper than the brand’s own fitting.\n\nRead More →\nExplore Kitchen Fitting →\nBathroom Fitting in Blackburn\n\nFull bathroom installations, wet rooms and accessible bathrooms across Blackburn and the Ribble Valley — tiled, sealed and finished to last.\n\nFull Bathroom Fitting\n\nComplete installations — suite, tiling and finishing, watertight and built to last.\n\nRead More →\nWet Rooms & Showers\n\nWet rooms and walk-in showers, fully tanked, level-access and watertight.\n\nRead More →\nAccessible Bathrooms\n\nLevel-access showers, walk-in baths and mobility adaptations, fitted safely.\n\nRead More →\nExplore Bathroom Fitting →\nFitted Bedrooms in Blackburn\n\nFitted wardrobes, sliding-door wardrobes, dressing tables and built-in storage across Blackburn and the Ribble Valley — scribed, levelled and finished for a floor-to-ceiling built-in look.\n\nFitted Wardrobes\n\nSingle, corner and floor-to-ceiling wardrobe runs, scribed for a flush built-in finish.\n\nRead More →\nWren Bedroom Installation\n\nIndependent fitting for Wren and other b",
